specs/hal-engine-architecture/spec.md:350:- Usage an earlier round reported is kept when a later round reports none, so a tool round does not erase the token count ([validated by: keeps the usage an earlier round reported when a later round reports none](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L570)).
specs/hal-engine-architecture/spec.md:351:- The usage `afterModelResponse` receives is `totalUsage`: the sum of what every provider call in the turn reported, so a turn that ran tools counts every round rather than the last one alone ([validated by: sums the usage of every round, not only the last](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L588)).
